			<br />
			
			<!--Main Content start-->At Arnold Palmer Hospital for Children, we pay careful attention to creating a comfortable,
stress-free environment for children. That may be one of the <a href="http://www.arnoldpalmerhospital.com/news-and-events/news/arnold-palmer-hospital-named-one-of-the-best-childrens-hospitals" target="_blank" style="color:#008fc7;">reasons we're ranked among the
best </a>in seven different pediatric specialties. We'll give you a call to confirm a day
and time that works for your family as soon as possible.<!--Main Content end--><br />
			<br />
			<strong style="font-family:'Minion Pro', 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #008fc7; font-size: 18px;"><!--CTA start-->While you wait, hear from people like you.<!--CTA end--></strong><br />
